{"unit_id":"Aik358__dsh-literature#card-zh","repo":"Aik358/dsh-literature","commit":"fc6650ef12747de08512d99c2f9c8388572b7724","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Literature 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的文献管理插件，在侧边栏提供文献库和内置 PDF 阅读器，并通过 DSH 工具接收文献检索、解析与保存请求。它能从文本识别 DOI、arXiv ID、PMID、ISBN 和标题，查询元数据与开放获取全文，管理本地文献条目，按关键词搜索已保存的文献，生成 APA、GB/T、MLA、Chicago 和 BibTeX 引用，还可导出到 Zotero 或目录。适合需要在 DSH 中整理研究资料、阅读论文和撰写引用的用户。基本文献解析使用外部元数据服务；可选使用 Zotero，无需必填 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/node/index.js:18-58","src/node/tools.js:85-147","src/client/index.cjs:110-190","src/node/pipeline.js:92-178"]}
{"unit_id":"Aik358__dsh-literature#card-en","repo":"Aik358/dsh-literature","commit":"fc6650ef12747de08512d99c2f9c8388572b7724","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Literature manages papers in the DSH web sidebar. It identifies papers from DOI, arXiv ID, PMID, ISBN, or title, looks up metadata, searches saved records, and creates APA, GB/T, MLA, Chicago, or BibTeX citations. Read PDFs in the built-in viewer and save papers locally or export them to Zotero.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/node/index.js:18-58","src/node/tools.js:85-147","src/client/index.cjs:110-190","src/node/pipeline.js:92-178"]}
